WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing heavy punch begins the near-corner confirm.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.350
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches.

3
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.250
The OD air grab spends two Drive bars.

4
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.200
Sprint launcher picks up the rebound.

5
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.950
The actual red-punch command plants one heavy bomb; the can counter reads two.

6
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.950
Ryu rises beside the planted bomb.

7
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:07.100
The planted bomb detonates automatically.
